@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
|Student|
start
:Upload proof of registration;
|System|
if (PDF / JPG / PNG, 5 MB or less,\nreal file signature?) then (no)
  :Error pop-up;
  stop
endif
#FFF2CC:Read text (OCR);
#FFF2CC:Remove ID numbers;
#FFF2CC:**AI** classifies and extracts\nfields (20 s budget);
note right
  If the AI is down or slow:
  rule-based reading
end note
if (TUT proof of registration\nand still current?) then (no)
  :Reject at once with the reason;
  stop
endif
:Fill in the form;
|Student|
:Check details, set password, tick consent;
|System|
if (Typed details match\nthe document?) then (no)
  if (Third attempt?) then (no)
    :Ask to correct the fields;
    stop
  else (yes)
    :Unverified account +\nstaff review (POPIA s71);
    stop
  endif
endif
:Account verified, proof deleted,\nconfirmation email sent;
|Student|
:Press Confirm my email;
:Add a photo (one clear face);
|System|
:Issue card (card number,\nlive QR code);
|Verifier|
:Scan QR -> LIVE CODE;
stop
@enduml
